Changelog v1.2.0

- Fixed player quality stuck at 360p and live streams not working.
- Fixed miniplayer close button causing flash.
- Merged latest commits from Litube.
- Add Youtube Music to the app.
- Added Download and add to queue buttons in the native context menu.
- Fixed incognito mode changing navigation bar colors.
- Fixed incognito mode showing stale recommendations for signed out sessions.
- Improved watch page buttons loading and added 'add to queue' button in action bar.
- Fixed volume booster feature not actually boosting volume.
- Fixed layout issues in watch page.
- Fixed video title clipping in various places.
- Improved the queue bar and container.
- Improve download resuming logic.
- Fixed playback quality preference.(not following settings)
- Fixed close button of queue bar not showing in light theme.
- Added bottom recommendations bar in player.
- Fixed toggles not working for some settings.
- Added default preferences for all settings.
- Applied performance optimizations.
- Improved downoads list record.
- Improve the sponsor skip feature.
- Added History and Playlists buttons in the navigation bar.
- Added in-app update downloading and installation.